<title>JAPAN: Cosmo Oil to shut part of Chiba refinery in May.</title>
<headline>Cosmo Oil to shut part of Chiba refinery in May.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmo Oil Co Ltd plans to shut part of its Chiba refinery in May for routine maintenance work.</p>
<p>Facilities to be affected by the turnaround are as follows:</p>
<p>Facility			 Capacity		Date</p>
<p>			     (barrels per day)</p>
<p>Topper no.1		    110,000		 May 12 - June 22</p>
<p>Catalytic reformer no.1     11,500		 May  9 - June 29</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.2   26,000		 May 19 - June 21</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.3   55,000		 May 13 - June 21</p>
<p>Vacuum gas oil</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphfuriser	 35,000		 June14 - July 5</p>
<p>Direct fuel oil</p>
<p>  desulphuriser no.10	 36,000		 May 13 - June 18</p>
<p>Direct fuel oil</p>
<p>  desulphuriser no.20	 36,000		 Oct  1 - Nov 15</p>
<p>Fluid catalytic</p>
<p>  cracker			 25,000		 unclear</p>
<p>Other main facilities at the Chiba refinery which are not scheduled to undergo maintenance work this year are as follows:</p>
<p>Topper no.2		    130,000</p>
<p>Vacuum distillation unit    60,000</p>
<p>Catalytic reformer no.2     25,000</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.1    8,000</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.4   45,000</p>
<p>Cosmo Oil's other crude distillation units which are due to undergo maintenance work this year are as follows:</p>
<p>Refinery			 Capacity		Date</p>
<p>Yokkaichi no.6		 75,000		  Sept 16 - Nov 4</p>
<p>Sakaide			 140,000		  June 13 - Aug 1</p>
<p>Crude distillation units which will skip maintenance work this year are as follows:</p>
<p>Chiba no.2		    130,000</p>
<p>Yokkaichi no.5		 80,000</p>
<p>Sakai			   110,000</p>
